This product includes a port of Google's material-color-utilities
(https://github.com/material-foundation/material-color-utilities), licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0, in the CAM16 viewing conditions
(conversion/cam16_view.nim) and the HCT solver (conversion/hct_solver.nim).
The port preserves the algorithm and constant tables; the Material DEFAULT
viewing conditions are frozen. The original copyright notice and patent grant
apply.

This product includes ports of the APCA (apca-w3 0.0.98G) and BridgePCA
(bridge-pca 0.1.6 4g-W3) perceptual contrast models by Andrew Somers (Myndex),
licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License, in contrast/apca.nim and
contrast/bridgepca.nim. The ports preserve the version-pinned constant tables
and the SAPC/BPCA core verbatim; the sign convention (BoW positive, WoB
negative) and the BridgePCA WoB bridge term are reproduced exactly. The
original copyright notice and disclaimer apply.